<http://data.silknow.org/object/cc3432b8-422c-3b8f-8703-aaaab75a1979>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Woman's waistcoat, silk velvet,  embroidered with metal thread and spangles and applied braid, Serbia, 1850-1899"@en , "Woman's waistcoat of silk velvet, embroidered with a close raised pattern of wavy flowering stems within compartments outlined by parallel stripes; along the lower edge is a scrolled border. There are fourteen gilt metal ornaments attached to each side, and two bands for fastening in front embroidered with silver-gilt thread and spangles. Cotton lining."@en ;
